#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:48
msgid ""
"Commands:\n"
"  search [pattern]   list matching icon names\n"
"  which [-a] name    print icon path(s)\n"
"  info name          print icon metadata\n"
"  libraries          list discovered icon libraries\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copy icons into the project\n"
"  push [pattern]     upload icons (not implemented)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   open themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              generate web preview and/or FAISS index\n"
"  delete name...     remove local icon files\n"
"  rename old new     rename local icon files\n"
"  copy from to       copy local icon files\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  link local icon files\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  derive local variants\n"
"\n"
"Pattern: empty=all, exact name, glob, or /regex\n"
"Plain English words also match synonyms/inflections (scored).\n"
"Local commands operate under project-dir/local-dir (default: icons/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Comandi:\n"
"  search [pattern]   elenca i nomi delle icone corrispondenti\n"
"  which [-a] name    stampa il/i percorso/i dell’icona\n"
"  info name          stampa i metadati dell’icona\n"
"  libraries          elenca le librerie scoperte\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copia le icone nel progetto\n"
"  push [pattern]     carica le icone (non implementato)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   apri themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              genera anteprima web e/o indice FAISS\n"
"  delete name...     elimina i file icona locali\n"
"  rename old new     rinomina i file icona locali\n"
"  copy from to       copia i file icona locali\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  collega i file icona locali\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  deriva varianti locali\n"
"\n"
"Motivo: vuoto=tutti, nome esatto, glob o /regex\n"
"Le parole inglesi semplici corrispondono anche a sinonimi/flessioni (con punteggio).\n"
"I comandi locali operano sotto project-dir/local-dir (predefinito: icons/).\n"

